   "id": "err-d-row",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "The code below sets <code>d[j] = i</code> for each 1 in row $i$ before the row is used, so $d[i][j]$ is the largest row number from $0$ to $i$, row $i$ itself included, not to $i - 1$. Including row $i$ is what gives a cell that holds a 1 the height $i - d[i][j] = 0$, so that no zero submatrix ends on it."
  },
